        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Rockford, Chicago, Carlsbad, San Diego County, California\n- Airports: Chicago Rockford International Airport, McClellan–Palomar Airport\n- Codes: IATA CLD, ICAO KCRQ, FAA LID CRQ\n\nFacts:\n- Chicago Rockford International Airport is located four miles south of the city center of Rockford and 85 miles northwest of Chicago.\n- McClellan–Palomar Airport is a public airport located three miles southeast of Carlsbad in San Diego County, California.\n- McClellan–Palomar Airport has the codes IATA CLD, ICAO KCRQ, and FAA LID CRQ.",
